<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.T9.1.2.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">“Direct presence of the now… awareness centered only on maintaining the loop.” </span>
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.T9.1.2.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">“Present interaction. Current state. Immediate focus.”</span></span>
