<span id="A1.T11.5.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T11.5.5.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Informative, Disciplined, Sequential, Concise, Focused</span></span>
</span></td>
